# Generated lab state stays local; publication uses an explicit file manifest.
**/config/
**/private/
**/runtime/
**/recordings/
**/exports/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
**/tools/*
!**/tools/reference-manifest.json

